  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidioni kūbiza ngunanhi wa Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bakīīta hangī ī yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; nang'hwe ūbatūūla mu makono ga Bamidiani ikanza lya myaka mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bamidiani būbaluhya no a Baisilaeli, kūshisha nose yūbigeleelwa kwibeegeja mahalo mu ngūlū, ga kwilang'hanīla, na machongo na mapilinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī makanza a Baisilaeli baabizaga ūlū bahamba ī shilīwa, Bamidiani biizaga hamò na Baamaleki na banhū bangī ba kūfuma sī ja kīya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biizaga baabakenaagūja ī shilīwa shabo ī shoe, pye a mapandī, kūshisha Gaza; baasolaga pye gete ī shikolo ī shipanga ū mu Isilaeli, baalī bataabalekelaga shose shose, jibize ng'holo, ng'ombe, nūūlū nzobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biizaga na mitugo jabo na maheema gabo; bingī no gītī njige. Yaalī shilambu ū kūbabala a banhū benabo nī ngamīla jabo; ūlū bashika bīkenaagūlaga no ī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī ya Midiani īkabakoya no a Baisilaeli, kūshisha nose būnīlīīla ū SEEBA abagune.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'hangi kūtūng'wa na SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho baanīlīīla ū SEEBA kūlwa nguno ya Bamidiani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū SEEBA ūbatūmīla ng'hangi kwiza kūbawīla, “Ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli alīhaya gīkī, A bing'we nakang'wenha kūfuma Misili, nūng'wīnja mu sī ya būsese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamupula ū mu būdūla bo būsugi bo Misili, nū kūfuma ū mu nkono gwa baluhya bing'we a bose nūng'wīnja, nūūbapeeja būng'wīngīla, nūng'winha bing'we ī sī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūmuwīla gīkī, Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu, yaya ū kūbalamya a baamulungu ba Baamooli abo balī ū mu sī īyo mukwikalaga. Alīyo mutanidegelekile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidioni kwitanwa na SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA akiiza Ofla, wigaasha mu mbeho ya ntī gwaalī ng'wilaale lya ng'wa Yoashi muna Abiezeli, hipandī īlo ng'witūnja wakwe Gidioni waatūlaga ngano ng'wikamīlo lya mizabibu, kūlwa kūjibisa a Bamidiani batizūjibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA aho wang'wilongela ū Gidioni ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū SEEBA alī hamò nang'ho bebe ngosha wa nguzu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Gidioni ūnshokeja ūhaya, Ū SEEBA ūlū alī hamò niise, nibūlī īkūtūgwīīlaga mihayo īlī gīkī? Īlī halī ī mihayo yakwe ī ya kūkumya īyo baatūwīīla bakūlūgenji bise bakūhayaga gīkī, “Ū SEEBA atatwīngije mu sī ya Misili? Alīyo ī haha ū SEEBA watwībile gete, watūponije mu nkono gwa Bamidiani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūngalūkīla ūng'wīla, “Jaaga ū mu būdūla wako weenūbū, ūkabapīje a Baisilaeli kūfuma ū mu nkono gwa Bamidiani. Natūkūtūmaga nene?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Gidioni ūhaya gīkī, “SEEBA nadūgije kinehe ū kūbapīja a Baisilaeli? Ū lūdūgū lwane lūlī lūdūgū lūgokolo gokolo ū mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase; hama nū nene ng'wenekīlī nalī ndo wa bado ū mu kaya ya ng'wise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū SEEBA ūng'wīla gīkī, “Nakūbiza hamò nang'ho, na lūūlū ūkūbatūla a bana Midiani; nīyo ū kūlī bebe bakūbiza gītī alī munhū ūmò dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni ūshosha alīhaya, “Alilūūlū ūlū wanibonaga gīkī nigeleelilwe ū kūbūtongi wako, ninhage shimanīīkījo sha kūnoolekeja gīkī ng'hana ūlī bebe ūyo ūlīyomba naane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīlomba ūtizīnga a henaha kūshisha nize, nakwenhele inong'ho lyane nize nakūtengele.” Nang'hwe ū SEEBA ūhaya, “Nakūkūlindīīla kūshisha ūshoke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha sha ng'wa Gidioni kwanukūlwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni wingīla mu kaya ūsīnza kabūlī kasongi, hūna ūsola nusu latili ya būsu ūbeeja migatī ītī na shibimbya; aho wagolanya, ī nyama ūjitūūla mu kasonzo, ū sūji ūgūtūūla mu nungū, hūna ūshenha a mbeho ya ntī gwenūyo wiza ūntengela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Jisolage ī nyama nū ngatī ūyo gūtī na shibimbya ūshitūūle a hiwe aha, hūna ū sūji ūgwitīīle ho.” Ū Gidioni wīta chene ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA ūtūmamīla nang'ha ūyo walī nago mu nkono, wīīkuumya ī nyama nī migatī īyo ītī na shibimbya. Gūūpuumūka moto kūfuma a hiwe, gūūjipemba ī nyama nī migatī īyo ītī na shibimbya; ū Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA ūjimīīla ī likanza lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gidioni aho wabona gīkī gashi walī Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA; ūkumya alīhaya, “Ee SEEBA Ndūji wa shose, ī lelo naamona Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA būshū kū būshū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Malaika o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wīla alīhaya, “Īnjaga ū boobà, mhola ībize hamò nang'ho, ūtūūcha yaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Gidioni ūzenga ng'walīlo kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA a henaho, ūgwitana lina lya, “Ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ī Mhola yenekīlī.” Kūshisha lelo ū ng'walīlo gwenūyo gūlīho gwīmīīlile ī Ofla ya Baabiezeeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidioni kūkambagūla ng'walīlo go ng'wa Baalī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wenūbo ū SEEBA ūng'wīla gīkī, “Īsolage ī nzagamba ya kabīlī ū kafuma ū ng'widaale lya mitugo ja ng'wa so, ī ya myaka mpungatī. Nū ng'walīlo go ng'wa so ūyo gwazengwa kūlwa ng'wa Baalī ūgūkambagūle, nī ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Ashela īyo yihelile nago wīgwishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūzenge ng'walīlo kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako a higūlya ya kaalūgūlū kenaka a ha lenganīzu, ūtūmamīle mawe gaawiz ūgahele chiza. Hūna ī ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Ashela īyo ūlīīgwishe wīīpandagūle jibize ng'hwi ja kūpemba, wīfunyī ī nzagamba ya kabīlī kūbiza shakwinha shakūpemva.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Gidioni ūsola batūmami bakwe ikūmi wīta gīt'ūmo SEEBA akang'wīlīla. Alīyo atīītile līīmi, akīta būjikū nguno akabogoha a ba ha kaya ya ng'wawe, na a banhū ba mu nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī dilū aho baamisha a banhū ba mu nzengo, būgūbona ū ng'walīlo go ng'wa Baalī gwakambagūkaga, nī ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Ashela īyo yalī hihī nago yagwaaga; nī nzagamba ī ya kabīlī yafunyiagwa shitambò a ha ng'walīlo ū mpya ūyo gūkazengwa būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bandya kwibūūja balīhaya, “Nani ūyo wagwītaga ū mhayo gwenūyū?” Aho baagīsīlīja chiza būwīlwa gīkī, “Ūyo wagwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo Gidioni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yoashi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū ba mu nzengo būng'wīla ū Yoashi, “Mfunyage aha ū ng'witūnja wako; shing'wigeleelilwe ache ī lelo, nguno wagūkambagūlaga ū ng'walīlo go ng'wa Baalī, wīgwisha nī ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Ashela īyo yihelile nago.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yoashi ūbashokeja abo baalī bampīndya bapelanile; ūbawīla, “A bing'we hū mulīnwīlīīla ū Baalī? Mutogilwe kūmpīja? Ūyo alanwīlīīle Baalī akūbūlagwa ī dilū yenīyī! Ū Baalī ūlū ng'hana alī mulungu adūgije kwilwīlīīla wei ng'wenekīlī īkī ū ng'walīlo gwakwe gwakambagūlagwa na munhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Gidioni būng'winha lina lya Yelubaa, nguno bakahaya gīkī, “Ū Baalī ni alwaage nang'hwe, ilwīlīīle wei ng'wenekīlī;” īkī wakambagūlīlagwa ū ng'walīlo gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo a Bamidiani na a Baamaleki, hamò na a banhū bangī a ba kū sī ja kīya bikuminga hamò; būsanja a mabità gabo, būgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani biza būtūūla ng'hambī yabo mu sī ya ntubīlo gwa Yezileeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla ū Gidioni, ūfuula mhembe kūbalaalīka bana Abiezeeli banondeele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūma nhūng'wa hose pyī ū mu sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase, kūbalaalīka kūbūūcha shilanga, nū kū banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Zabuloni, na a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Nafutali; pye a benaba būja kwisangīja na a bichaabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikūnza kūbiza būlolelo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Gidioni ūng'wīla ū Mulungu gīkī, “Ūlū gīkī ūkūbapīja ng'hana a Baisilaeli mu nzīla ya nkono gwane ūmo wahayīlile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha naanikīla ikūnza lya ng'holo ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla aha. Ūlū lūlaabize lūme a ha ikūnza lya ng'holo dūhū, ī sī ī yīngī yūbiza hūūmu, a henaho hū nakūdeeba gīkī ng'hana a Baisilaeli ūkūbapīja kūbītīla mu nkono gwane gīt'ūmo wahayīlile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana h'ūmo yūbiizīla, ū Gidioni aho wamisha ī dilū ūlīsola ī likūnza ūlīkama ū lūme, ookaja ibbakuli lya minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Gidioni ūhaya hangī gīkī, “Nalīkwikūmbīlīja ūtizūnipelanīla; nalīlomba mhayo gūmò dūhū hangī. Nizunīlījage nalītūmamīle hangī ī likūnza lyenīlī; ī lelo ī likūnza lyikale lyūmu, ī sī īyo īlīpīndīlīgije hū īlobe lūme.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wenūbo ū SEEBA wīta gīko ng'hana; ī likūnza lyikala lyūūmu, ī sī īyo yalī īlīpīndīlīgije yūloba lūme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
